  the unfortunate reality is that to some  degree we're all slightly narcissistic  and what i mean by that is anybody who  i mean okay if you're neurodivergent  then there this this may not apply okay  but  for for people who are you know not  autistic  and you decide i'm gonna have a show  where i give my opinion  there's some degree of narcissism there  there has to be because somewhere you  believe that  your opinion may be as opposed to  or different than millions and millions  and millions of people who  it never occurs to do a show your  opinion  is of some value entertainment or it's  something that other people would want  to listen to so  you're going to have a lot of  interesting and different personalities  in this space but within that there's a  huge huge spectrum  and by its nature you're going to get  this  this stuff within the space and i think  that  there are aspects of it that aren't good  for the progressive movement  but i don't think it's ultimately going  to be destructive  in in the way that some believe it's  going to be because much of the survival  of this very space the online left  depends on conflict and depends on  controversy and  so the the idea that it will become a  distraction from policy sure  but it's not going to destroy the space  overall we'll have more of this on our  instagram you can follow us  on instagram at davidpakmanshow and i'd  love to hear your thoughts as well  one of our sponsors is curiositystream  a subscription streaming service that  offers  thousands of documentaries from some of  the world's best filmmakers  including titles you can't find anywhere  else if you  are serious about watching documentaries  and you don't have curiosity stream  i don't even know what you're doing my  girlfriend and i  have not been able to get enough  curiosity stream  we can watch it on the tv smartphone  ipad  all of the devices they have  documentaries on politics history  science economics technology i recently  watched ber